{
  "status": "PASS",
  "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
  "rate": "+5%",
  "seconds": 35.089,
  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.06,
      "end": 0.3306239,
      "text": "How does a"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.3435,
      "end": 1.0393739,
      "text": "net stop a"
    },
    {
      "start": 1.052292,
      "end": 2.108958,
      "text": "twenty-ton boulder?"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.3689319999999996,
      "end": 3.2838899999999995,
      "text": "Mountain roads hang"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.2967649999999997,
      "end": 4.121515,
      "text": "steel nets on"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.13439,
      "end": 4.598306999999999,
      "text": "the slopes"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.611224,
      "end": 5.152431,
      "text": "above them."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.412405,
      "end": 5.837655,
      "text": "The net is"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.85053,
      "end": 6.765488,
      "text": "woven from steel"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.778363,
      "end": 7.628863,
      "text": "rings, like"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.64178,
      "end": 8.298988000000001,
      "text": "chain mail."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.558962000000001,
      "end": 9.035754,
      "text": "When a rock"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.048670000000001,
      "end": 10.053837000000001,
      "text": "hits, the net"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.066712,
      "end": 10.646628000000002,
      "text": "doesn't try to"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.659504000000002,
      "end": 11.432670000000002,
      "text": "stop it dead."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.692644000000001,
      "end": 12.465852000000002,
      "text": "It stretches like"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.478727000000001,
      "end": 13.728768000000002,
      "text": "a trampoline, more"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.741602000000002,
      "end": 14.566352000000002,
      "text": "than twenty feet."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.826326000000002,
      "end": 15.316034000000002,
      "text": "And the ropes"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.328909000000001,
      "end": 15.883034000000002,
      "text": "that hold it"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.895909000000001,
      "end": 16.411409000000003,
      "text": "pull through"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.424284000000004,
      "end": 17.223242000000003,
      "text": "brake rings."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.483216,
      "end": 18.385257,
      "text": "These steel loops"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.398132,
      "end": 19.635257,
      "text": "shrink and bend,"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.996091,
      "end": 20.820798999999997,
      "text": "turning the speed"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.833716,
      "end": 21.426506999999997,
      "text": "into heat."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.686481,
      "end": 22.408147,
      "text": "A slow stop"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.421022999999998,
      "end": 23.284439,
      "text": "keeps the forces"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.297314,
      "end": 24.057648,
      "text": "low, so"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.070522999999998,
      "end": 24.98548,
      "text": "nothing snaps."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.245454,
      "end": 26.134619999999998,
      "text": "The biggest nets"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.147495,
      "end": 27.152662,
      "text": "stop twenty tons"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.165537,
      "end": 28.041828,
      "text": "at sixty miles"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.054703999999997,
      "end": 28.49287,
      "text": "an hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.752844000000003,
      "end": 30.299261,
      "text": "Afterward, crews clear"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.312136000000002,
      "end": 31.059552,
      "text": "the rock and"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.072427,
      "end": 32.116219,
      "text": "replace the brakes."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.376193,
      "end": 32.904526000000004,
      "text": "That's what those"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.917401,
      "end": 33.664859,
      "text": "steel nets on"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.677734,
      "end": 34.334942,
      "text": "mountain cliffs"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.347818000000004,
      "end": 34.889026,
      "text": "are for."
    }
  ],
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.308932,
      "narration_en": "How does a net stop a twenty-ton boulder?",
      "source_audio_sha256": "b31c38fde7ac1217d2c7b6867fd6cff4ef4201efb5c8949939027bbf350c814d"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.308932,
      "end": 5.352405,
      "narration_en": "Mountain roads hang steel nets on the slopes above them.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "7d29cc2fe611b181abe47eb874ccf69d66396a856eb9e0500f4fedfa39a339c3"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.352405,
      "end": 8.498962,
      "narration_en": "The net is woven from steel rings, like chain mail.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "5f607788c4cffdae7aeb81d934f359fcaf6786b31b8c6fa23181bae806d4fcf9"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.498962,
      "end": 11.632644,
      "narration_en": "When a rock hits, the net doesn't try to stop it dead.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "d1729b759aaee2dbfdb6f288d51d58406519e422942a6a205f823adb1510474e"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.632644,
      "end": 14.766326000000001,
      "narration_en": "It stretches like a trampoline, more than twenty feet.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "995822d5998de44394546bcd521eba369fd27e57c8fc2d3daa9e4ae6e0b5cdb3"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.766326000000001,
      "end": 17.423216,
      "narration_en": "And the ropes that hold it pull through brake rings.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "12ed6906e4028d365d2333ada2b005929bec89f5fdb61dea8f194514423c4b1e"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.423216,
      "end": 21.626481,
      "narration_en": "These steel loops shrink and bend, turning the speed into heat.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "54816fdc26b8305aba58f177cb2304f2130473fdc8602c4e0c7a5a4a7b7a5ca8"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.626481,
      "end": 25.185454,
      "narration_en": "A slow stop keeps the forces low, so nothing snaps.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "40608a5acd396c962f1a0d08e00a5d8e19e85b64a5556f6b9a7a8cbae41694c0"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.185454,
      "end": 28.692844,
      "narration_en": "The biggest nets stop twenty tons at sixty miles an hour.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "52d4c823d6675f7a6070eed46d8f81cfd5f9837523fabfcd6bd66d98357ee253"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.692844,
      "end": 32.316193,
      "narration_en": "Afterward, crews clear the rock and replace the brakes.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "6dd737b0debfe6da53b84588bbda9def1ca3526bc1b3d2ac9e4d7e6b08c575e0"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.316193,
      "end": 35.089,
      "narration_en": "That's what those steel nets on mountain cliffs are for.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "99563732ca72630ad565fa81f6b9a32a2663e836013dd0759b39d9ebfdb9049a"
    }
  ],
